WINDOW win1 as (partition by ow_sale.vn order by ow_sale.ord, ow_sale.cn desc,ow_sale.pn desc,ow_sale.cn asc rows current row ); -- mvd 7,2,1->6; 
 pn  | vn | pn  | qty  | prc  |      to_char      | cn 
-----+----+-----+------+------+-------------------+----
